"94","the Messenger of Allah ﷺ said, """"Allah has divided between you your characters just as he has divided between you your provisions. Allah gives worldly ˹provisions˺ to the one He loves and to the one whom He does not love, but He does not faith except to the one He loves.""""[^1]"
