"2463","A black man came to the Prophet ﷺ and said, """"O Messenger of Allah, I am a black man with a foul odor and an ugly face, and I have no wealth. If I fight these people ˹in the path of Allah˺ until I am killed, where will I be?"""" The Prophet ﷺ said, """"In Paradise."""" So he fought until he was killed."
